  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small Modular Reactor Study Technical Assistance, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds technical assistance (TA) for Bulgarian Energy Holding (BEH), the state-owned energy company in Bulgaria responsible for most of Bulgaria&apos;s power generation assets. The TA would provide BEH with a detailed assessment of BEH-selected U.S. nuclear small modular reactor (SMR) designs and vendors. This assessment is intended to support the later deployment of a nuclear power plant by BEH in the early 2030s in line with the country&apos;s energy security and decarbonization goals.</narrative>
  </description>
